<%# A start QuBe Sync hasn't confirmed for a minute: posts to retry_url, which sends it again with
    the same reference. The words are I18n's: qube_rails.status.try_again. %>
<%= button_to QubeRails.t("status.try_again"), run_status.retry_url, class: qube_classes(:button, "qube-retry-start"),
              form: { class: "qube-retry-start-form" } %>
